WEBVTT

00:00:00.750 --> 00:00:01.150
A marks the approved FieldWorks reading. PanGloss built the same reading, so no decision is needed; matching results have no outcome mark or PanGloss line. A, U and D mean Approved, Unknown and Disapproved.

00:00:01.150 --> 00:00:01.550
U means the reading is stored but not yet approved. PanGloss built the same reading, so there is no outcome mark or PanGloss line. Approve changes U to A.

00:00:01.800 --> 00:00:02.200
The Staged note records a choice waiting for Apply. Undo removes it.

00:00:02.200 --> 00:00:02.600
The dashed mark means FieldWorks has no reading stored. A solid ≠ and underline mark the new reading PanGloss found.

00:00:02.600 --> 00:00:03.000
D marks the stored reading as Disapproved. PanGloss still builds it, so the reading conflicts with that opinion.

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:03.400
There is no reading stored in FieldWorks, and PanGloss found no complete reading.

00:00:03.400 --> 00:00:03.800
PanGloss stopped before finishing its search. The dotted ◖ and underline mark the unfinished search; other readings may still exist.

